{"etape": 12, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-27T11:22:18.364619Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "I found your reservation **4NQLHD**:\n\n- **Outbound:** HAT190 IAH→LAS + HAT047 LAS→SEA on May 23 (economy)\n- **Return:** HAT021 SEA→JFK May 26 + HAT279 JFK→IAH May 27 (economy)\n- **Passengers:** Liam Khan, James Kim, Aarav Lee (3)\n- **Insurance:** Yes\n\nSince you want to move the IAH→SEA portion to **May 24** and upgrade **all flights to business class** (cabin must be uniform across the reservation), here are the available one-stop options on May 24:\n\n| Option | Flight 1 | Flight 2 | Business price/passenger |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **A** | HAT190 IAH→LAS, May 24, 1:00 AM–4:00 AM | HAT047 LAS→SEA, May 24, 1:00 PM–3:30 PM | $464 + $202 = **$666** |\n| **B** | HAT112 IAH→LAS, May 24, 10:00 PM–1:00 AM (+1) | HAT047 LAS→SEA, May 25, 1:00 PM–3:30 PM | $404 + $417 = **$821** |\n| **C** | HAT286 IAH→LAS, May 24, 10:00 PM–1:00 AM (+1) | HAT047 LAS→SEA, May 25, 1:00 PM–3:30 PM | $399 + $417 = **$816** |\n\nThe return flights (HAT021 on May 26 and HAT279 on May 27) would remain the same but be upgraded to business.\n\nCould you please confirm:\n1. **Which option** (A, B, or C) you'd like?\n2. **Which payment method** to use for any fare difference — Visa ending 3422, Mastercard ending 9448, or gift card ($62)?"}, "resultat": "I think there might be a misunderstanding. I only want to change the IAH to SEA flight to May 24th and upgrade *that specific flight* to business class for all passengers. I don't want to upgrade all flights in the reservation to business class, just the IAH to SEA leg.", "erreur": null}
{"etape": 13, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-27T11:22:24.565894Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "I understand, but unfortunately that's not possible. Per policy, **the cabin class must be the same across all flights in a reservation** — I cannot upgrade just one leg to business while leaving the others in economy.\n\nHere's what I *can* do for you:\n\n1. **Change the IAH→SEA flights to May 24** (keeping economy for the entire reservation), or\n2. **Change the IAH→SEA flights to May 24 AND upgrade the entire reservation to business class** (all 4 flights).\n\nWould you like to go with option 1 or option 2?"}, "resultat": "Okay, I understand the policy. That's a bit frustrating, but I appreciate you clarifying.\n\nIn that case, I'm willing to upgrade for both the outbound and return flights. So, I'd like to go with option 2: change the IAH→SEA flights to May 24 AND upgrade the entire reservation to business class.\n\nCould you please tell me the total extra cost for this change, considering all passengers? I'd like to see the price before confirming.", "erreur": null}
